  "claim": "A heavy metal band Ugly Kid Joe released an album in 1991 with the song Everything About You. The album is a parody of 2 Live Crew's 1989 album. Chris Catalyst played with the band.",
  "evidencia": "Page: As Ugly as They Wanna Be. Sentence: As Ugly as They Wanna Be is an EP by the American heavy metal band Ugly Kid Joe.\nPage: As Ugly as They Wanna Be. Sentence: It was released in 1991.\nPage: 2 Live Crew. Sentence: 2 Live Crew is an American hip-hop group from Miami, Florida.\nPage: Everything About You (Ugly Kid Joe song). Sentence: It originally appeared on their 1991 EP, \"As Ugly as They Wanna Be\".\nPage: Chris Catalyst. Sentence: Chris Catalyst (born 11 February 1980) has been the guitarist and bass player from various British and American rock bands over the past decade, including The Sisters of Mercy, Ugly Kid Joe, Ginger Wildheart, Mariachi El Bronx, The Dead Pets, Pato Banton, Rankin Roger, AntiProduct and his own band Eureka Machines, as well as stints playing keyboards for Terrorvision and The Scaramanga Six.",
