        "original_id": "63eef2b5-e108-572c-be89-01445bf21056",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chris Catalyst\n- Music Groups: Ugly Kid Joe, 2 Live Crew\n- Albums and Songs: Everything About You, As Ugly as They Wanna Be, As Nasty as They Wanna Be\n\nFacts:\n- In 1989, 2 Live Crew released the album As Nasty as They Wanna Be.\n- In 1991, Ugly Kid Joe released the album As Ugly as They Wanna Be.\n- The 1991 Ugly Kid Joe album As Ugly as They Wanna Be is a parody of 2 Live Crew's 1989 album As Nasty as They Wanna Be.\n- The song Everything About You appears on Ugly Kid Joe's 1991 album As Ugly as They Wanna Be.\n- Chris Catalyst played with Ugly Kid Joe.",
