        "original_id": "e9fd9541-ff6b-58a2-91d6-8c12660132fe",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: As Ugly as They Wanna Be, Everything About You\n- People: Chris Catalyst\n- Organizations: Ugly Kid Joe, 2 Live Crew\n- Places: Miami, Florida\n\nFacts:\n- As Ugly as They Wanna Be is an EP by the American heavy metal band Ugly Kid Joe.\n- As Ugly as They Wanna Be was released in 1991.\n- Everything About You originally appeared on Ugly Kid Joe's 1991 EP As Ugly as They Wanna Be.\n- Chris Catalyst was born on 11 February 1980.\n- Chris Catalyst has played guitar and bass in British and American rock bands including Ugly Kid Joe, The Sisters of Mercy, Ginger Wildheart, Mariachi El Bronx, The Dead Pets, Pato Banton, Rankin Roger, AntiProduct, and Eureka Machines.\n- Chris Catalyst has also played keyboards for Terrorvision and The Scaramanga Six.\n- 2 Live Crew is an American hip-hop group from Miami, Florida.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "2037f922-28d1-501c-9369-d2b44729ab2f",
        "text": "Page: As Ugly as They Wanna Be. Sentence: As Ugly as They Wanna Be is an EP by the American heavy metal band Ugly Kid Joe.\nPage: As Ugly as They Wanna Be. Sentence: It was released in 1991.\nPage: 2 Live Crew. Sentence: 2 Live Crew is an American hip-hop group from Miami, Florida.\nPage: Everything About You (Ugly Kid Joe song). Sentence: It originally appeared on their 1991 EP, \"As Ugly as They Wanna Be\".\nPage: Chris Catalyst. Sentence: Chris Catalyst (born 11 February 1980) has been the guitarist and bass player from various British and American rock bands over the past decade, including The Sisters of Mercy, Ugly Kid Joe, Ginger Wildheart, Mariachi El Bronx, The Dead Pets, Pato Banton, Rankin Roger, AntiProduct and his own band Eureka Machines, as well as stints playing keyboards for Terrorvision and The Scaramanga Six.",
